[apogee] suite duo: no member holds memory on this machine
  /help                            List these commands
  /model [backend|model]           Show the backend answering, or switch: a backend, a roster model, or backend:model
  /models                          List the configured backends
  /suite [name]                    Show the suite and what its members hold, or switch to another (then --force, --warm)
  /symphonies                      List the symphonies /play can play
  /play <symphony> [input]         Play a symphony on the input: its stages on the suite's members, its output this session's answer
  /system <text>                   Replace the system prompt
  /temperature <number>            Set the sampling temperature
  /think [on|off|auto]             Show or set whether the model thinks first: on, off, or auto per question
  /effort [level|auto]             Show or set how hard the model thinks: low, medium, high, xhigh or max; auto leaves it to the model
  /thinking-display [summary|raw]  Show or set how reasoning is drawn while it streams: a summary line, or raw
  /max-tokens <number>             Cap each answer's length in tokens
  /compact                         Summarise the conversation so far, to free context
  /title <name>                    Rename this chat
  /retriever [mode]                Show or set how documents are searched: auto, lexical, vector or hybrid
  /rerank [backend]                Show or set the model that reranks search results, or off, or auto
  /branch [ref]                    Show or set the branch under review: head, base..head, or off
  /capture [status|link]           Save this conversation as a knowledge record
  /check                           Have the suite's verifier check the last answer, once
  /attach <path>                   Attach a file, folder or glob: inlined when it fits, retrieved when not (then --graph=code|off)
  /attachments                     List what is attached
  /todo                            Show the plan the model keeps for this session
  /detach <name>                   Detach an attachment
  /recall [on|off]                 Show or set whether turns recall earlier chats
  /private                         Never summarise this chat for recall
  /allow [tool|website]            Allow a tool or website for this chat; alone, list each answer
  /deny <tool|website>             Refuse a tool or website for this chat, without asking
  /revoke <tool|website>           Forget this chat's answer for a tool or website
  /permissions                     List each tool's answer and where it comes from
  /permission-mode [mode]          Show or set how much runs without asking: manual, accept-edits, plan, dont-ask or bypass (Shift+Tab cycles)
  /exit                            Save and leave
  /quit                            Save and leave
  NAME                  STAGES                        SOURCE                      DESCRIPTION
  critique-revise       utility → chat                shipped                     Critique a draft against what it is meant to do, then revise it to answer the critique.
  describe-answer       vision → chat                 shipped                     Describe an image with the vision member, then answer a question about it from the description.
  digest                play:summarize-verify → extraction shipped                     Summarize and check a passage by playing summarize-verify, then card it with a title, tags and a one-line summary.
  extract-actions       extraction                    shipped                     Pull the action items out of notes -- who does what, by when -- as one JSON document, held to its schema.
  extract-facts         extraction                    shipped                     Pull the key facts out of a text as one JSON document, held to its schema.
  redact-text           utility → chat                shipped                     List the personal details and secrets in a text, then rewrite it with placeholders in their place.
  summarize-verify      utility → chat                shipped                     Summarize a passage, then check the summary against the passage and correct it.
  echo2                 utility → chat                config                      Two stages, the second given the first's answer.
